FK33_THERM hbm/DRAM_0_STAT_TEMP connected
FK33_THERM hbm/DRAM_1_STAT_TEMP connected
FK33_THERM hbm/DRAM_0_STAT_CATTRIP connected
FK33_THERM hbm/DRAM_1_STAT_CATTRIP connected
